      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is already a planned feature for groups.\n\n\"In the next stage, which should arrive a short time after the initial release, we intend to add in search, as well as respond to the aforementioned user feedback.\"\n\nhttps://hello.vrchat.com/blog/vrchat-groups",
